        ["Why do chemotherapy agents commonly cause low blood counts?", ["Marrow cells divide rapidly, so they are also targeted", "The drugs directly destroy red cells in circulation", "Chemotherapy blocks iron absorption in the gut", "Blood cells are attacked only by radiation therapy"], "Chemotherapy targets fast-dividing cells, including hematopoietic cells in bone marrow."]
