        "<b>MLD</b>: light, slow skin stretch; clear proximal and functioning nodes first, then distal, always directing flow proximally.",
        "<b>Short-stretch bandages</b>: high working pressure, low resting pressure; gradient firmest distally. Long-stretch = high resting pressure, not for reduction.",
